{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"waystation_arrival","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":3,"title":"Weight of Pages","title_ko":"페이지의 무게"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/chapter_splash_belt_waystation.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The Belt was trying to forget it had ever been green.","text_ko":"벨트는 자신이 한때 푸르렀다는 사실을 잊으려 하고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Arrel and Elia had left Verdan at dawn. Malet's last words still sat behind Arrel's ribs: Someone is already going where you're looking.","text_ko":"아렐과 엘리아는 새벽에 베르단을 떠났다. 말렛의 마지막 말은 여전히 아렐의 갈비뼈 뒤에 박혀 있었다. '누군가 이미 당신이 찾는 곳으로 가고 있어.'"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Going. Not gone. Whoever it is, they're still moving toward BL-07.","text_ko":"갔다는 게 아니라, 가고 있다고 했어. 누구든 아직 BL-07로 이동 중이야."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"He unfolded the map. The warning at its edge would not become words. Every letter was familiar; together, they meant nothing.","text_ko":"그는 지도를 펼쳤다. 가장자리의 경고문은 단어가 되지 않았다. 글자 하나하나는 익숙했지만, 함께 놓이면 아무 뜻도 되지 않았다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"The route passes an old waystation. We can rest there.","text_ko":"길은 오래된 역참을 지나. 거기서 쉴 수 있어."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Two hours later they passed a Blanker dispensary. A child swallowed the white pill dry. Arrel waited to feel anger. Nothing arrived.","text_ko":"두 시간 뒤 그들은 블랭커 배급소를 지났다. 한 아이가 하얀 알약을 물도 없이 삼켰다. 아렐은 분노가 오기를 기다렸다. 아무것도 오지 않았다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/chapter_expansion/ch03_waystation_haze_v1.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"By early afternoon, an abandoned one-room stone waystation appeared where two overgrown paths met.","text_ko":"이른 오후, 잡초가 무성한 두 길의 교차점에 버려진 단칸 석조 역참이 나타났다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/waystation_arrival/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","source_hash":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Door is intact. Dust is undisturbed. Nobody's here.","text_ko":"문은 멀쩡해. 먼지도 흐트러지지 않았고. 아무도 없어."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"2b06c89af77ce5b187c244fc5478fd1f4296ad11e77fc180cda0ac5ca41a069b","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter3_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"bbd59b365314dbb0258eca53a4ca507894ad3d46af9dc601fdf783ceb280a6b9"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
